{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09631","headline":"骊姬墓下作 · 岑参","name":"骊姬墓下作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"骊姬北原上，闭骨已千秋。\n浍水日东注，恶名终不流。\n献公恣耽惑，视子如仇雠。\n此事成蔓草，我来逢古丘。\n蛾眉山月苦，蝉鬓野云愁。\n欲吊二公子，横汾无轻舟。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"岑参","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09631.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09631","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}